{"title":"홍연","artist":"안예은","sourceId":"reference:NO2Dfk90fv85sQovdx4r","sourceHash":"8afc3b5d0d469a36b2b798b3a772a8624e861b9ab5fbc745250321e97cbfa547","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":16.13,"end":19.13,"text":"세상에 처음 날 때","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":20.54,"end":23.54,"text":"인연인 사람들은","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":24.66,"end":27.66,"text":"손과 손에 붉은 실이","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":28.59,"end":31.59,"text":"이어진 채 온다 했죠","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":32.98,"end":35.98,"text":"당신이 어디 있든","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":37.1,"end":40.1,"text":"내가 찾을 수 있게","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":40.9,"end":43.9,"text":"손과 손에 붉은 실이","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":45.16,"end":48.16,"text":"이어진 채 왔다 했죠","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":66.24,"end":69.24,"text":"눈물진 나의 뺨을 쓰담아 주면서도","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":73.4,"end":76.4,"text":"다른 손은 칼을 거두지 않네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":79.0,"end":81.63,"text":"또 다시 사라져","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":81.63,"end":84.63,"text":"산산이 부서지는 눈부신","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":87.1,"end":90.1,"text":"우리의 날들이","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":90.16,"end":93.16,"text":"다시는 오지 못할 어둠으로 가네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":99.49000000000001,"end":102.49000000000001,"text":"아아 아아아 아아아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":107.87,"end":110.87,"text":"고운 그대 얼굴에 피를 닦아주오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":131.99,"end":134.99,"text":"나의 모든 것들이 손대면 사라질 듯","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":140.44,"end":143.44,"text":"끝도 없이 겁이 나서","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":144.7,"end":147.7,"text":"무엇도 할 수 없다 했죠","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":149.11,"end":152.11,"text":"아픈 내 목소리에 입맞춰 주면서도","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":156.2,"end":159.2,"text":"시선 끝엔 내가 있지를 않네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":161.81,"end":164.42000000000002,"text":"또 다시 사라져","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":164.42000000000002,"end":167.42000000000002,"text":"아득히 멀어지는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":168.8,"end":171.8,"text":"찬란한 우리의 날들이","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":172.82999999999998,"end":175.82999999999998,"text":"다시는 오지 못할 어둠으로 가네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":197.75,"end":200.75,"text":"산산이 부서지는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":201.9,"end":204.9,"text":"눈부신 우리의 날들이","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":206.32,"end":209.32,"text":"다시는 오지 못할 어둠으로","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":214.12,"end":217.12,"text":"당신은 세상에게 죽고","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":218.15,"end":221.15,"text":"나는 너를 잃었어","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":222.52,"end":225.52,"text":"돌아올 수가 없네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":226.66,"end":229.66,"text":"다시 돌아올 수가 없네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":231.6,"end":234.6,"text":"아아 아아아 아아아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":240.39,"end":243.39,"text":"고운 그대 얼굴에 피를 닦아주오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}